# Stripe secret key for the in-game gold-pack purchases (src/app/api/checkout,
# src/app/api/verify-purchase). Get it from https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Without it, the shop's real-money packs show "paiement non configuré" but the
# rest of the game (weapons, waves, in-game credits) works fine.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
